window.products.push({"id":1074022,"name":"Calvin Klein Home Modern Cotton Heathered Charcoal Cropped Logo Throw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n0lWyHeQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Inspired by classic Calvin Klein underwear, modern cotton bedding is made from the same ultra-comfortable cotton-modal fabric. Soft, youthful cotton-modal bedding, taking its cues from well-loved garments, like a favorite T-shirt or hoodie. Supple Jersey cotton in a dynamic new palette with oversized logo accents. Form meets function in this classic and casual modern cotton cropped logo throw, in a soft cotton-modal. Featuring cropped, iconic logo detailing for timeless appeal. The throw is inspired by Calvin Klein jeans' hoodies. Available in 3 color ways: Charcoal, grey, oat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n0lWyHeQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calvin Klein","source_asin":"B094HHYZRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094HHYZRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094HHYZRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074023,"name":"Sussex Home Non Skid Washable Kitchen Runner Rugs Set of 2 - Ultra-Thin Lattice Area Rugs for Laundry Room, Entryway, Bathroom - Multipurpose Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817cfNeHh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"First impressions matter, so give your home indoor floor rugs that are stylishly inviting, protective, and conveniently simple to maintain. The Sussex Home washable kitchen, entryway, and bathroom mat set are designed in a range of timeless patterns in classic colorways to be instantly adored and admired the minute you step inside your home. Safeguard Your Home Floor in Style Our eye-catching indoor rugs for front doors, kitchen, or laundry room are purpose-designed to protect the floor and safeguard the user against accidental slips caused by water or oil spilled on the floor. Our protective non-slip backed flooring mats not only elevate home decorations but assure maximum safety, security, and comfort. Non-Skid Quality for Versatile Use These protective non-slip backed flooring mats are made of lightweight, soft, and durable 70% cotton and 30% polyester material, preventing slipping on all floor types. With under 1/4\" in thickness to fit under the doors, our rugs for home are ideal as indoor door entry rugs, laundry mats for laundry room, and kitchen floor mats for in front of sinks. Unique Stylish Patterns for All Surroundings With quality materials paired with the latest technology in printing, our non slip area rugs will complement the modern and vintage decor by adding stylish accents and interlaced patterns in bold colors and head-turning prints. Machine Washable for Worry-Free Maintenance Wash at 30°C Wash at 30°C Tumble dry at low temperature Tumble dry at low temperature Air dry if needed Air dry if needed Product Details: Package Contains: 2 x Modern Low Pile Rugs Package Contains: 2 x Modern Low Pile Rugs Material: 70% Cotton and 30% Polyester Material: 70% Cotton and 30% Polyester Sizes: 44\" L x 24\" W and 31.5\" L x 20\" W Sizes: 44\" L x 24\" W and 31.5\" L x 20\" W Thickness: 1/4\" Thickness: 1/4\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817cfNeHh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUSSEXHOME","source_asin":"B08PHL3TS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PHL3TS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PHL3TS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074024,"name":"Evolution by Waterford Cosmic Fire Paperweight","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCg+nd3AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Waterford's Evolution collection of fine art glass, infused with exotic color patterns, continues to \"evolve\" with new pieces in edgy, yet classical form. This collection of Pink and Amethyst features colors that create their own individual oasis in pastel designed to calm and relax and then shift gears to colors of pink and brilliant yellow found in the most dramatic and eternal sunsets. The shapes are soft and contemporary and are designed to create dramatic interest in any home. Amazon.com A sure-fire conversation starter, this creatively designed paperweight sets a dramatic mood in a contemporary home or office setting. Fiery pink and amber swirls tempered by transparent bubbles are encased inside a heavy, solid glass globe. Like volcanic flares frozen in time, the mesmerizing swirls draw the eye again and again. Mouth-blown by skilled glassworkers in Poland, each brilliantly clear paperweight exhibits unique properties and stands approximately 2-1/2 inches high. Waterford makes the same piece in blue and green, called the Cosmic Waters paperweight. Evolution, inspired by the forms and colors of nature, is Waterford's most avante garde collection. Encompassing vases, bowls, candle votives, and more, the art glass collection bursts with sophisticated color combinations, asymmetrical shapes, and a lively aesthetic. Packaged in a handsome Waterford logo box, each Evolution piece makes a superb special occasion or corporate gift. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCg+nd3AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B000EUJKMA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EUJKMA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EUJKMA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
