window.products.push({"id":1074099,"name":"E-Macht Evaporative Air Cooler with Fan & Humidifier, 3-in-1 Portable Air Conditioners, 3 Speeds & 3 Modes, 80° Oscillation Swamp Cooler for Bedroom w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IYazojqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❉【3-in-1 Evaporative Air Cooler】This device combines with a fan, humidifier and air cooler function. Compared with traditional fans, this swamp cooler has higher safety and faster cooling speed. And its working power is about 60W, which is much lower than an AC unit, reducing the energy consumption. ❉【Water Tank & Ice Packs】The 3L water tank can easily support for a whole night, outputting cool and moist air. No need of frequent refills. By adding the included 2 reusable ice cubes into the water tank, this cooling fan will blow out much cooler air and produce more efficient cooling effect. ❉【3 Modes & 3 Wind Speeds】The portable air cooler is equipped with 3 modes (natural/normal/sleep) and 3 wind speeds (low/mid/high), you can choose the most comfortable one. There is also a 12H timer function for more convenient use during night. And its low noise (≤35dB) will not disturb your sleep. ❉【Touch or Remote Control】Two control modes are available, a touch panel on the top and a remote control with a range up to 20ft. Therefore, you can conveniently adjust the room cooler whether you are on the sofa or in bed. With 80° oscillation function, our tower cooling fan can cover a larger space in your room. ❉【Safe and Portable】The bladeless design not only makes this evaporative cooler much safer for kids and pets, but also easy to clean. Its compact size and portable carry handle ensure easy mobility, you can effortlessly move it around your home, office or other places. If you have any problem when receiving the device, please contact us in time and we will help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IYazojqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E-Macht","source_asin":"B0B4DNZP96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DNZP96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DNZP96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
