window.products.push({"id":1074116,"name":"121pcs Dried Pampas Grass Decor, Boho Home Table Fall Decor Dried Flowers, White & Natural Pampas Grass, Reed Grass, Bunny Tails, 17 inch Pompass Gras","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zoB2t9iyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury 121PCS/13 KINDS OF PAMPAS GRASS - This dried pampas grass comes with everything you need for the ultimate DIY experience, The dried flower bouquet has 13 varieties, including 10pcs white pampas,20pcs natural pampas grass,15pcs white bunny tails pampas grass, 15pcs brown bunny tails, 2pcs fluffy pampas, 10pcs elf grass, 2pcs Valentiness grass, 5pcs rich bean grass, 5pcs white billy buttons, 5 x white wheat stalks, 1 x Baby's breath, 1pcs octagon star flower and 30pcs reed grass. HIGHEST QUALITY NATURE DRIED FLORAL - Our dried flowers mix is made with superior quality, handpicked and naturally dried flowers. They are 100% natural and non-toxic requires no maintenance, light or watering. Save your time, money and energy with these beautiful all natural dried floral decor. Simply fluff it up, arrange as desired in a vase, and enjoy for years! BOHO FLORAL ARRANGEMENTS - Used for boho floral arrangements, feathers for floral arrangements, boho wedding bouquets and great as fall floral decor as well. Dried pampas is versatile and perfectin any vase to add a rustic feel to home decor, boho wedding decor, party decor etc. This pampas bouquet must be a lovely door-to-door gift for your family or friends! FIT ANY VASE - Our pampas grass decor is about 17.5 inches/45cm tall, If you are looking for fall decor for your home, office and farmhouse, this natural dried flower bouquet is an ideal choice! You also can shorten the length of the pampas grass bouquet to adapt to your own vase, so as to achieve your desired decoration needs. Creating fullness and an interesting texture for your boho home decor. Be ready for our attention-grabbing pampass grass to stand out in any room! PAMPAS GRASS CARING TIPS - Nature dried pompous grass must be compressed to ensure safe transport. The pampas will be fluffed up again in the sun for a few hours or use the low heat of a hairdryer to loosen them. It's normal to shedding, as the pampas are 100% natural flowers. Spraying hairspray on the final flower arrangement is effective to reduce shedding. (Before bringing pampas grass into your house, gently shake off the shedding down)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zoB2t9iyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Agotglmi","source_asin":"B0BVZZDZS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZZDZS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZZDZS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
