window.products.push({"id":1074245,"name":"Luma Gems Agate Coasters Set of 4 - Authentic Geode Stone Coasters for All Types of Glasses and Decor - Premium Coaster Set with Rubber Bumpers to Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jj+rVaOpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Gold Plated Rim Coasters Agate Stone is a microcrystalline variety of quartz formed from gas bubbles on past volcanic eruptions or by the dissolution of sedimentary concretions over millions of years. Each agate geode is hand selected for its natural and unique beauty, hand cut in halves, and polished. They are one of the world's most prized minerals and known to carry great power with them. Agates and Crystals are believed to bring balance and renew energies of a place and the living beings around it. Color: Blue Set Contains: 4 Coasters and 4x4 Rubber Bumpers Made of High Quality and Hand Polished Natural Brazilian Agate Stone. The surface of these coasters has a polished finish while the outer rim keeps the natural rough crust of the Agate. Each set of coasters is Unique in shape, size, weight, and crystal pattern due to natural variation. You will receive a distinctive set of coasters similar to the photo. Rubber Bumpers included for STABILITY and PROTECTION of your furniture. HOW TO USE: FOR YOUR COFFEE: Indulge your breakfast and avoid coffee rings on the table. FOR YOUR DRINK: A special occasion deserves a special decoration, use as part of your upscale bar with wine, whiskey, brandy, etc. FOR YOUR TABLE SETTING: Bring out your personality with these agate coasters to decorate your table in any occasion. FOR DECOR: These coasters look amazing anywhere in your house, at the bar, kitchen, poolside, office desk, table number, or even hang as a modern wall agate decor art. A SPECIAL GIFT: Agate Slices are the perfect wedding gift idea, to new homeowners, a birthday gift to your friends, or anyone that connects with nature will be thrilled to receive these unique specimens. HOW TO CLEAN: Just wipe off any spill or stain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jj+rVaOpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luma Gems","source_asin":"B08B3Y65XR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3Y65XR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3Y65XR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
