window.products.push({"id":1074315,"name":"Food Grade Round Tin Container Set (6 Pieces) 4 Oz with Clear Top Lid Cover: Professional Restaurant and Home Kitchen Use to Keep Dry Condiments, Herb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xuNJi6kNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"You get 6 pieces of premium quality food grade quality (dry food) tin containers (4 Fluid Oz Each) to store various dry food condiments, spices, herbs and more. The tins are round with a clear durable plastic window lid and measures approximately 2.4\" in width x 1.63\" in height. A Perfect size to keep your essential cooking ingredients nearby. These premium tins are the preferred by restaurant chefs to use routinely for every day cooking: Easy to identify contents, convenient to store, and practical replenishing cycles. A must have for a professional kitchen. Not recommended to use with liquids or other wet ingredients. Use them also as a Favor Tin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xuNJi6kNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfume Studio","source_asin":"B00KVUGL1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KVUGL1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KVUGL1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074316,"name":"Multi-Propose Microwave Steamer 40.5 fl.oz. 18.5 fl.oz. BPA free Pack of 2 Made in Korea (Medium, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jZ1s5IgpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multi-Propose Microwave Steamer 1. This microwave Steamer makes it easy for you to cook. 2. You can cook potatoes, sweet potatoes, dumplings, Korean-style steamed eggs, soup and, most of all, ramen comfortably. 3. You can save time in busy hours. 4. It does not boil over or make a mess in the microwave due to the tiny steam escape hole on the lid.  Item Dimensions: Medium (L8.46 x W7.3 x H4.14 inch), Small (L6.49 x W5.7 x H3.35 inch) Microwave Noodle Bowl - Medium [HOW TO USE] 1. Wash the bowl with a soft brush before using it. 2. Ramen bowl is optimized for one serving, so please refer to them. 3. Add the soup powder first and place the noodles on top of it. 4. Add a moderate amount of water. 5. Close the lid and put it in the microwave and operate it. 6. Check the time and intensity of the microwave. Cook in 5 minutes if hot water is added or in 7 minutes if cold water is added. In addition to basic ramen, you can cook a variety of ramen with your favorite ingredients such as green onions and eggs. Steamed Eggs Bowl - Small [HOW TO USE] 1. Wash the bowl with a soft brush before using it. 2. Put more than 2 eggs and water in a bowl. The important point is that eggs and water should be the same proportion.(Korean-style steamed eggs are cooked by breaking eggs and mixing them with water) That way, you can make a delicious steamed egg. 3. Stir in eggs and water to mix well. 4. Chop and add good ingredients such as scallions, onions, carrots, etc. 5. Close the lid and put it in the microwave and operate it. 6. Check the time and intensity of the microwave. Cook soft eggs for 3 minutes, usually 5 minutes. If you want to add cheese, you can add the steamed eggs after they are almost cooked and turn the microwave a little. ※ Do not use in gas stove, induction, or oven. Only use in microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jZ1s5IgpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"abkitchen","source_asin":"B088M1QCYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088M1QCYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088M1QCYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
