window.products.push({"id":1074336,"name":"GoWISE USA GWAC22004 5.8-Quarts 8-in-1 Digital Air Fryer with 6-Piece Accessory Kit + 100 Recipes (White), QT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hNJfs1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthier cooking in 30 min Or Less: thanks to rapid air technology, you can now experience your favorite food without the extra calories. This air fryer can fry, bake, grill and roast with little to no oil. Modern touch screen design: sleek and modern look with advanced touch screen menu. New features include a start/stop button allowing you to change your program mid-cycle, as well as a built-in alarm function to remind you to shake your ingredients in 5, 10, and 15-minute increments. 8 preset cooking options & manual controls: enjoy 8 pre-programmed cooking functions including fries/chips, pork, chicken, steak, shrimp, cake, fish and pizza. Or, use the manual controls to customize to your needs. This air fryer is equipped with a wide temperature range from 180F to 400F and a timer for up to 30 minutes. Air fryer accessory set included: Includes 8-inch baking pan, 8-inch pie/pizza pan, insert rack, kabob rack, toasting/warming rack, silicone Mat. Recipe book included: Includes 50 recipes specifically made for GoWISE USA air fryers. Get started today with 50 step-by-step recipes to explore all that your new kitchen gadget has to offer. Treat the Moms in your life to this family-sized air fryer that will make it easy to create healthier versions of her favorite fried foods in 30 minutes or less.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hNJfs1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoWISE USA","source_asin":"B07TY22MZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY22MZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY22MZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
