window.products.push({"id":1074473,"name":"GSM Brands Stemless Wine Glass for Nurses and Doctors (Because Patients) Made of Unbreakable Tritan Plastic and Dishwasher Safe - 16 ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWwpHaCDL._AC_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GIFT FOR NURSES AND DOCTORS - This classy 16 oz plastic wine glass is a great gift for nurses and doctors that need a drink after a long day. It can be perfectly used for beer, whiskey, cocktails, ice cream, yogurts and dessert cups. Make ice cold drinks by filling your wine with a bit of juice and put them in the fridge. Minutes later you have a perfect base for cocktails. UNBREAKABLE - Made of the finest grade A Tritan plastic, 100% BPA free that keeps you & your family safe from leached chemicals. Never be worried about broken glass at your party, around the pool, hot tub or playground area. These glasses won’t crack or shatter in the freezer, even when their liquids freeze. CONVENIENT & VERSATILE - These crystal clear glasses are comfortable to handle for both hot and cold drinks, keeping you and your guest’s hands clean and dry. This glass is the perfect choice for indoor or outdoor social events, dinner parties, cocktail-pool parties or weddings. COMES IN AN ATTRACTIVE GIFT BOX - This wine glass comes in a custom designed box, making it the perfect gift for birthdays, christmas or nurse appreciation day. BECAUSE PATIENTS - You may wake up in the morning and enjoy one (or a few) cups of coffee. But after you've seized the day and enjoyed all those lovely patients, it's definitely time for something a little stronger. The glass makes a great gift for doctors, nurses, PA, pharmacists and other medical professionals for the holidays or nurses appreciation week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWwpHaCDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GSM Brands","source_asin":"B07L5XL6JC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5XL6JC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5XL6JC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074474,"name":"Gbuzozie Video Game Controller Background Lunch Bag Insulated Portable Reusable Gaming Theme Lunch Box With Zipper For Women Men Picnic Beach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619e02YuiKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLE: Personalized design, suitable for people over 3 years old such as kids, children, boys and girls, teenager, adults, women and men. MATERIAL: The lunch bag is made of high-density oxford cloth and thick aluminum foil. It can keep your food cool or warm for about many hours. It can make your food fresh and delicious. Freezing in ice packs is better and fresher. SIZE: 4 x 8 x 10inches. FEATURES: ①EASY CLEAN: Waterproof internal and external make it easy to clean, say goodbye to dirty bags. ②LARGE CAPACITY: Enough space to pack your food containers, snacks, drinks, fruits and other foods. This lunch bag can be used as tote bag, lunch box, picnic bag, sundry bag, suitable for all age groups. ③UNIQUE DESIGN: Show your sense of fashion and special characteristics of art. Say goodbye to ugly boring lunch bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619e02YuiKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gbuzozie","source_asin":"B0BY13NGFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY13NGFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY13NGFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074475,"name":"Hasipu 24 x 36 Inch Bathroom Mrror for Wall, Black Bathroom Mirror with Non-Rusting Brushed Aluminum Metal Frame Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ssSowNYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Practical and decorative framed mirror】HASIPU 24 x 36 Inch bathroom wall mirror is made of HD glass and premium Brushed Aluminum metal frame. Rectangle shape with round corner of the framed mirror features the modern style. Offers both gold and black for coustomer to choose from. Meets the decor needs to industry, rustic and modern style of bathroom, bedroom vanity, entryway, farmhouse, hotel or salon. 👍【Durable Brushed Metal Frame】 Aluminum alloy frame adopts straight grain brushed and thickened baking paint process to enrich the edge of this bathroom mirror with metallic luster and texture. Anodizing process makes the metal frame waterproof and antirust. Durable and non-deformed shape. 👍【5mm Shatterproof Glass】Our bathroom mirror adopts 4-layer float technology, Excellent silver plated layer provides HD refection to ensure 1:1 restoration of real image without any distortion. And shatterproof film is the important layer to keep people safe once the mirror is broken in accident. 👍【Secure & Easy Hanging Option】This lightweight wall mirror comes with more reinforced \"+\" holes on the back and screws that can be hung horizontally or vertically. Just drive the screws into the wall and choose two holes to hang the mirror on the screws to complete installation.Besides, the mirror can be leaned to the wall as decoration. 👍【Wide Application】: A ideal contemporary mirror for wall decor with brushed metal frame, very classic, perfectly goes with any decor. Each mirror is made to a secret standard and secured with customized thick foam in carton box. Before delivered, it passed all rigorous tests including dropping, impact test etc. Only for you to provide the perfect mirror. Promise 100% broken/chipped mirror on arrival replacement or refund guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ssSowNYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hasipu","source_asin":"B0BNHJP1SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNHJP1SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNHJP1SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074476,"name":"Holy Lamb Organics Quilted Wool Deep Sleep Mattress Topper - TWIN XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":459.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NOYC2kQGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since wool is the most breathable of all bedding materials, your body will love sleeping on top of an organic wool mattress topper. If you have a synthetic mattress, creating a natural sleeping surface is the best thing you can do for your body. Holy Lamb Organics hand crafts their organic wool toppers using Premium Eco-Wool batting tufted between 2 layers of organic cotton fabric. Designed to lay flat on top of the mattress without shifting. The Holy Lamb Organics Quilted Wool Deep Sleep Mattress Topper is the perfect choice for adding just a little more softness to your mattress, but not the full loft of The Ultimate Wool Topper. Hand tufted. Spot Clean Only. Twin: 38x75, 5.6 pounds; XL Twin: 38 x80, 6 pounds; Full: 54 x75, 7.9pounds; Queen: 60x80, 9.3pounds; King: 76x80, 11.8 pounds; CA King: 72x84, 11.8 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NOYC2kQGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holy Lamb Organics","source_asin":"B005013SWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005013SWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005013SWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074477,"name":"Berkshire Softest Microloft Full/Queen Blanket, Periwinkle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ouExhxGIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Luxuriously soft and warm, our Microplush blanket has a beautiful drape and a silky hand. But don't let the softness fool you, its non-pilling fibers make it durable and easy to care for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ouExhxGIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Berkshire Blanket","source_asin":"B000MAWITO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000MAWITO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000MAWITO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1074478,"name":"Boho Ceramic White Bud Vases by Kate Aspen (Set of 3) - Boho Vase for Pampas Grass, Eucalyptus, Dry Flowers & Plants | Shelf Decor, Mantle Decoration,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nz9n0mUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We love Boho! We love all the textures and nuances that can happen with this beautiful neutral pallet. The dried flowers and the palms and the macrame bring us so much joy. We really wanted to design a vase or vases in this case that would be a great accompaniment to the Boho theme without being too distracting. The Boho Ceramic Bud Vase set does just that. Each set includes three vases with varying sizes and individual textures that make them great on their own without anything in them or they highlight whatever piece of nature you happen to put inside. We love them all together as a centerpiece for a wedding reception or for decorating your holiday table. They are a great way to carry your boho style throughout your home or your party. So often boho is more of a vibe than just a theme. These vases can go from day to Night without having to change outfits. We really wanted to bring the feel of handmade in each set. They are perfect for a boho wedding with pampas and dried flowers or used at a garden party with fresh cut flowers to boost your tablescape. With the textured exterior these vases blend perfectly with the rustic farmhouse vibe wedding and then fitting in perfectly with a minimalist aesthetic after the event. Are you looking for the perfect gift for mothers day or looking to decorate for a baby shower? These bud vases are perfect. They match every event and every aesthetic which makes them essential to have on hand. With so many ways to use them you will want to make sure you have extra sets on hand!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nz9n0mUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B0BV42L1R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV42L1R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV42L1R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
