window.products.push({"id":1074551,"name":"SPT WA-1140DE Dual-Hose 11,000-BTU Portable Air Conditioner with Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317MERSBPbL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 11,000btu, 3 in 1 system provides multi-season comfort. Designed to efficiently cool, dehumidify any space without permanent installation. Effectively improves air circulation in poorly ventilated spaces. Dual hose systems provide fast cooling with one hose for air intake and the other for air exhaust. Self Evaporating Technology during the cooling or heating process, water is extracted from the air into the unit. In Cool mode, most of this water is recycled and used to cool the cooling coils. This creates improved cooling efficiently without adding energy cost. The moisture is then pushed out with the exhaust air, leaving you a virtually no drain unit. In extreme humid conditions, if condensation collects faster than the unit can evaporate, the excess water will collect in the built in tank. When the tank becomes full, compressor will automatically shut off and unit will indicate that drainage is needed. Exhaust hose installation required and all standard accessories included. Included plastic slider kit forms up to 6.75 ft. Specifications Cooling capacity: 11,000btu / hour Power consumption: 1253 W Amperage: 10.9A Air volume (CFM): 176 Moisture removal: 51 pints/day Operating temp: 64 - 110�F Thermostat: 64 - 90�F Control: digital with LCD EER: 8.78 dB (High / Low): 49 /43  Power supply: 115V / 60Hz Max room size: 350 sq. ft. Timer: 1 - 24 hours Fan speeds: 3 (Auto - High - Low) Compressor: Rotary Refrigerant / Load: R22 / 1.45 lb Exhaust pipe max length: 5.5 ft. Exhaust pipe diameter: 5.25 in. Window kit material: Plastic slider kit Window kit length: Min: 28.25 in. / Max: 81.5 in. Product dimension (L x D x H): 18 x 18.5 x 33.5 in. Package dimension (L x D x H): 20.5 x 23 x 35 in. Net weight: 82 lbs. Gross weight: 88 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317MERSBPbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPT","source_asin":"B000OZUI30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OZUI30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OZUI30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
