window.products.push({"id":1074562,"name":"Deror Natural Bamboo Chasen Set Matcha Green Tea Whisk Long Handle Powder Brush Tool For Matcha Making(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610uiwdN2iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Regarding us To learn more about our products, you can click on ➡️\"Jingmingya US\" to enter our store homepage. We look forward to your visit. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us. We will provide assistance within 24 hours, please do not worry. Specification Condition: 100% Brand New Item Type: Chasen Material: Bamboo Optional Color: White, Purple Height of Whisk: Approx. 15cm/5.91in Top Diameter of Whisk: Approx. 3cm/1.18in Bottom Diameter of Whisk: Approx. 1.5cm/0.59in Long Length of Accessory: Approx. 5cm/1.97in Short Length of Accessory: Approx. 2cm/0.79in Diameter of Accessory: Approx. 2cm/0.79in  Chasen was a tea-making tool in ancient times. Chasen was made from a finely cut bamboo block. Chacha modern has become a must-have in Japanese tea ceremony for mixing powdered tea. The tea maker first uses a Japanese slender tea and puts powdered tea in a tea bowl, and then adds hot water with a handle. After that, powdered tea and water were stirred with a tea scoop to form a foam. Package list 1 x Bamboo Whisk Long Handle 1 x Accessory Note The size of each may be slightly different, but it does not affect the use of the product. Please note that the new type and old type of this product will be sent randomly, and make sure you will not mind before ordering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610uiwdN2iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deror","source_asin":"B0949BHV2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0949BHV2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0949BHV2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
