window.products.push({"id":1074643,"name":"ZXZ Meat Tenderizer Removable 48 stainless steel blade Easy To Use & Clean (black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dbqQndHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TO BE A PROFESSIONAL CHEF】48 Stainless Steel blade can creates tiny channels within the meat and break down the connective tissues which make meat tough and chewy to getting much more juicy and flavorful meat. Whether a family gathering or Christmas, you can enjoy a festive feast with ease. 【Quick marinade and cooking】These tiny channels within the meat allow marinades to be fully absorbed into the meat quite quickly without waiting for too long. It’s suitable for a lot of meat. You can use it to tenderize beef, turkey, veal, chicken, pork, steak, fish, etc. 5 minutes of marinade, reducing cooking time by up to 40%. Less cooking time means less loss of natural flavors and juices. 【Best design】With the newly upgraded detachable structure, you can easily remove the 48 blades according to the machine logo, manually clean and simply assemble them. There are 4 drainage holes in the fuselage, so there is no need to worry about water accumulation in the handle. If you have a dishwasher in your home, it is dishwasher safe without disassembly. 【EASY TO USE】The grip design is easy to press , grip and saves effort. The elderly people can also use it easily, and they don't need to worry about the meat tenderizer slipping from their hands. it is the perfect gift for Mother's Day and Father's Day. The blade expands into the meat when pressed, automatically retracts the steel needle when no force is applied. No Scratching. 【BEST GIFT】 Simple-use kitchen tools that you'll love once you use it, a great gift for family and friends. ZXZ provides you with high-quality products and services. 24 hours to reply to any questions you may have. Please be assured of the purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dbqQndHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZXZ","source_asin":"B09ZPCZ9LH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1074643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZPCZ9LH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZPCZ9LH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
